<div class="interiordet"> 
<h2><a href="http://cclor.blogspot.com/" rel="bookmark" title="Welcome to StockTrader.sg">Welcome to StockTrader.sg </a></h2> 
<p>A place where I share my knowledge and stock tips to everyone who are interested in trading. You are welcome to share your thoughts and leave your comments. Feel free to give your suggestion to improve the site. <br/>
<strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Please do not treat any part of the content as an inducement to trade. All contents shared here are from my personal view. 
